  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Leif Larsen Music Centre</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support music trainings at the Leif Larson Music Centre in Altit, Hunza. The Leif Larson Music Centre was established by AKCS-P and offers training to youth in the Gilgit Baltistan (GB) region. The objective of this intervention is to promote local musicians and encourage young people to acquire training in local music. Under this project, music students, including students with disabilities, will receive training in indigenous musical traditions from specialized musicians.</narrative>
  </description>
